    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d334d889-7f27-5a4b-bc83-1ca86af54db9" activityNameId="3ff3e82c-edaa-5898-9cab-06700c485df4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 10MW, offshore, monopile substructure</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 10MW, offshore, monopile substructure
UUID=e7aaf097-d6fc-39c1-946e-30e5c6ea3dc2
Wind turbine substructure (including transition piece), at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data of material inputs are based on the IEA reference 10MW offshore wind turbine using a monopile substructure.
The distance to installation port is assumed to be 80 km. The average water depth is 34 m. 
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.

Main data source: 
Kainz, S. (2025). Life Cycle Inventory of the IEA Wind 740-10-MW Reference Offshore Wind Plant with irregular layout [Dataset]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/ZENODO.15880601
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e7aaf097-d6fc-39c1-946e-30e5c6ea3dc2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
